# Report the machine geometry declared by this primitive's deployment
# config: the drawable area in the paper frame (mm) and the two pen
# heights (mm). Static per machine; changes only with the config.
#
# The status contract is a topic_out stream and is not consumable as a
# request/response RPC, so consumers read geometry here instead.
---
bool    success
string  message
float64 x_min
float64 x_max
float64 y_min
float64 y_max
float64 z_up
float64 z_down
